---
import ResearchLayout from "../../layouts/ResearchLayout.astro";
---
<ResearchLayout title="P2｜Editor's Note｜J 的世界 Research" page="P2" section="EDITOR'S NOTE">
<div class="editorial-page">
  <div class="editorial-topline">
    <span>EDITOR'S NOTE</span>
    <span>2026.06.25 · TSMC TECHNOLOGY SYMPOSIUM</span>
  </div>

  <div class="editorial-hero">
    <div class="editorial-hero-copy">
      <div class="editorial-word">EDITORIAL</div>
      <h1>為什麼想聊<br/>台積電 6/25 技術論壇？</h1>
      <p class="editorial-sub">因為那天，看到的不只是技術，而是一個正在演化的未來。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="editorial-orbit" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="orbit-core"><span>AI</span><b>PLATFORM</b></div>
      <div class="orbit-line one"></div>
      <div class="orbit-line two"></div>
      <div class="orbit-line three"></div>
      <div class="orbit-node n1">TECH</div>
      <div class="orbit-node n2">SYSTEM</div>
      <div class="orbit-node n3">INDUSTRY</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="editorial-columns">
    <section class="editorial-left">
      <div class="eyebrow">聊聊這場論壇，先不要急著想股票</div>
      <p class="opening">2026 年 6 月 25 日，台積電在上海舉辦技術論壇。對我們來說，有意思的不是又多了一場技術發表，而是這場論壇把製程、封裝、需求與產能放在同一張圖裡。</p>
      <p>所以我們想從這裡開始聊聊：當 AI 的需求一路往上走，半導體產業接下來究竟在變什麼？</p>

      <div class="signal-intro">
        <strong>這場論壇，提出了四個關鍵訊號：</strong>
        <div class="signal-line">
          <span>AI / HPC 需求</span><i>｜</i><span>2 奈米家族</span><i>｜</i><span>先進封裝技術</span><i>｜</i><span>全球產能擴張</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="editorial-conclusion">
        <p>它們看似分屬不同領域，卻指向同一件事：</p>
        <h2>AI Platform 正在進入新的演化階段。</h2>
        <p class="short-line">技術，不再只是技術。<br/>而是整個產業下一步的方向。</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside class="editorial-right">
      <div class="right-heading">
        <span class="round-mark">◎</span>
        <h2>我們相信，研究應該回到最重要的事。</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="principle-list">
        <article>
          <div class="principle-icon">⌕</div>
          <div><h3>回到證據本身</h3><p>不是消息，不是傳聞，<br/>而是從事實出發。</p></div>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="principle-icon">◌</div>
          <div><h3>理解背後的邏輯</h3><p>不是追逐市場情緒，<br/>而是理解事件背後的因果關係。</p></div>
        </article>
        <article>
          <div class="principle-icon">↗</div>
          <div><h3>看見長期的結構變化</h3><p>不是只看短期波動，<br/>而是看見產業正在改變的方向。</p></div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="editorial-note-text">
        <p>這不是一本講題材的刊物。</p>
        <p>而是一本試圖理解產業、技術與投資之間關係的研究誌。</p>
        <p class="bold-note">我們不預測未來，<br/>我們試圖理解未來的形成過程。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="highlight-quote">
        <span>“</span>
        <div><small>HIGHLIGHT QUOTE</small><strong>不是追逐消息，<br/>而是理解變化。</strong></div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
.editorial-page{border:1px solid #d4d8dc;background:#fbfaf7;padding:34px 40px 30px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.editorial-topline{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd5dc;padding-bottom:10px;color:#6d7884;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:700}
.editorial-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:30px;align-items:center;padding:30px 0 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #d8dde2}
.editorial-word{font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;font-size:clamp(3.4rem,8vw,7.2rem);font-weight:700;line-height:.82;letter-spacing:-.055em;color:#0b1d35;opacity:.95}
.editorial-hero h1{margin:18px 0 0;font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.55rem);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.035em;color:#0b1d35}
.editorial-sub{margin:14px 0 0;color:#9a6b25;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.55;max-width:620px}
.editorial-orbit{min-height:285px;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center}
.orbit-core{width:150px;height:150px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid #b98932;display:grid;place-content:center;text-align:center;color:#0b1d35;background:rgba(255,255,255,.78);box-shadow:0 0 0 18px rgba(185,137,50,.05),0 0 0 52px rgba(7,26,51,.035)}
.orbit-core span{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:2.4rem;line-height:1;font-weight:700}.orbit-core b{font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.18em;margin-top:7px}
.orbit-line{position:absolute;border:1px solid rgba(7,26,51,.17);border-radius:50%;transform:rotate(-18deg)}.orbit-line.one{width:275px;height:125px}.orbit-line.two{width:310px;height:175px;transform:rotate(35deg);border-color:rgba(185,137,50,.42)}.orbit-line.three{width:225px;height:225px;transform:rotate(12deg);border-color:rgba(7,26,51,.1)}
.orbit-node{position:absolute;background:#0b1d35;color:#fff;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.12em;padding:6px 8px}.orbit-node.n1{top:24px;right:10%}.orbit-node.n2{bottom:22px;left:6%}.orbit-node.n3{top:45%;right:-2px}
.editorial-columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.02fr .98fr;gap:38px;padding-top:28px}.editorial-left{padding-right:10px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#b98932;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:13px}.editorial-left p{margin:0 0 13px;color:#354456;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.9}.editorial-left .opening{font-size:1.08rem;color:#24354a}
.signal-intro{margin:26px 0 25px;padding:18px 0;border-top:1px solid #cfd5dc;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd5dc}.signal-intro strong{display:block;color:#0b1d35;font-size:1.08rem;margin-bottom:10px}.signal-line{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;color:#667585;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.7}.signal-line span{font-weight:700;color:#24354a}.signal-line i{font-style:normal;color:#b98932}
.editorial-conclusion{padding:4px 0 0}.editorial-conclusion h2{margin:2px 0 10px;color:#0b1d35;font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1.45}.editorial-conclusion .short-line{font-weight:700;color:#9a6b25;line-height:1.7}
.editorial-right{border-left:1px solid #d4d9de;padding-left:30px}.right-heading{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}.round-mark{width:34px;height:34px;border:1px solid #b98932;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#0b1d35;font-size:19px;flex:0 0 auto}.right-heading h2{margin:0;color:#0b1d35;font-size:1.3rem;line-height:1.45}
.principle-list{margin-top:20px}.principle-list article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:38px 1fr;gap:12px;padding:15px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d8dde2}.principle-icon{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#0b1d35;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:17px}.principle-list h3{margin:0 0 3px;color:#0b1d35;font-size:1rem}.principle-list p{margin:0;color:#617080;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.65}
.editorial-note-text{margin-top:20px;padding-top:17px;border-top:1px solid #d4d9de}.editorial-note-text p{margin:0 0 7px;color:#4a5868;font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.7}.editorial-note-text .bold-note{font-weight:800;color:#0b1d35;margin-top:11px}
.highlight-quote{margin-top:20px;padding:14px 0 0;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start}.highlight-quote>span{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:4rem;line-height:.7;color:#b98932}.highlight-quote small{display:block;color:#b98932;letter-spacing:.16em;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:5px}.highlight-quote strong{display:block;color:#0b1d35;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.6}
@media(max-width:850px){.editorial-hero,.editorial-columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}.editorial-orbit{min-height:240px}.editorial-right{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid #d4d9de;padding:25px 0 0}.editorial-page{padding:26px 24px}.editorial-word{font-size:4.5rem}}
@media(max-width:560px){.editorial-topline{display:block}.editorial-topline span:last-child{display:block;margin-top:6px}.editorial-page{padding:22px 18px}.editorial-hero{padding-top:24px}.editorial-word{font-size:3.7rem}.editorial-hero h1{font-size:2.1rem}.editorial-sub{font-size:1rem}.editorial-orbit{min-height:210px}.orbit-line.one{width:230px}.orbit-line.two{width:250px}.orbit-node.n3{right:0}.editorial-columns{gap:25px}.signal-line{display:block}.signal-line i{padding:0 4px}}
</style>
</ResearchLayout>
